WEBVTT

00:00.590 --> 00:01.530
Morning!

00:01.530 --> 00:02.270
Morning!

00:02.610 --> 00:04.620
I heard Amane-san's taking the day off.

00:04.620 --> 00:05.730
They say it's a cold.

00:07.410 --> 00:10.220
<i>I never thought she'd get sick.</i>

00:10.220 --> 00:11.530
<i>It's so nice and peaceful.</i>

00:11.530 --> 00:12.510
Who's that?

00:12.510 --> 00:13.110
Dunno.

00:13.800 --> 00:15.220
Her hair's so nice.

00:23.050 --> 00:25.060
<i>Wh-Why is she here?!</i>

00:25.510 --> 00:27.230
<i>Is she going to attack me again?</i>

00:30.250 --> 00:31.200
Oh?

00:31.200 --> 00:32.510
Akutsu-kun, do you know her?

00:32.510 --> 00:33.360
Tanigawa?

00:33.360 --> 00:35.330
Ooh, who is she?

00:35.330 --> 00:37.340
Err...

00:37.710 --> 00:39.630
<i>"A lady with a nice figure"...</i>

00:39.630 --> 00:41.810
<i>wouldn't really cut it, would it?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:43.430
You don't need to worry.

00:43.770 --> 00:46.340
My name is Amane Lilia.

00:46.340 --> 00:50.140
I appreciate you taking care of 
my younger sister, Lily.

00:50.140 --> 00:51.900
I thank you on her behalf.

00:52.810 --> 00:54.650
<i>She can talk?!</i>

00:54.650 --> 00:56.220
Amane-san's sister?!

00:56.220 --> 00:57.760
She's so pretty.

00:57.760 --> 01:00.530
Huh? But why are you here?

01:01.220 --> 01:04.250
Is it not normal to take classes 
on another's behalf?

01:04.250 --> 01:07.020
That was the policy where I was before.

01:07.020 --> 01:08.610
It was?

01:09.100 --> 01:11.220
That's an odd policy.

01:11.220 --> 01:12.240
I see.

01:12.240 --> 01:13.890
That's unfortunate.

01:13.890 --> 01:16.210
I'll discuss it with the teacher.

01:16.210 --> 01:18.010
I'm sure he'll understand.

01:18.430 --> 01:21.510
<i>Is she planning to squat here 
using Amane's lie?!</i>

01:21.960 --> 01:24.640
All right, let's start morning greetings.

01:24.640 --> 01:26.030
Take your seats.

01:27.230 --> 01:28.360
Who are you?

01:28.360 --> 01:29.850
Get back to your class.

01:29.850 --> 01:33.000
Oh, Sensei, this is Amane-san's sister.

01:33.000 --> 01:36.490
She wants to attend class in place of 
her sister since she's indisposed.

01:36.490 --> 01:38.060
I'm pleased to meet you, Sensei.

01:38.060 --> 01:40.450
Thank you for taking care of my sister.

01:40.450 --> 01:43.490
Oh, Amane's older sister, huh?

01:43.490 --> 01:46.040
Sorry, but that's not a thing.

01:46.330 --> 01:49.040
I understand it's difficult, but may I please?

01:49.040 --> 01:52.370
I can't allow an outsider to stay in class.

01:52.370 --> 01:54.670
I'll have someone pass on the announcem—

01:54.670 --> 01:55.970
But I insist.

01:56.290 --> 01:58.090
May I please?

02:03.220 --> 02:05.880
J-Just for today, then.

02:07.810 --> 02:13.170
<i>I guess she wouldn't attack when there are 
so many people around... Would she?</i>

02:13.170 --> 02:14.810
<i>She might not even remember.</i>

02:15.150 --> 02:16.940
You must be Akutsu-kun.

02:16.940 --> 02:19.370
My sister has told me all about you.

02:19.370 --> 02:22.410
I'm told she's very much indebted to you.

02:24.030 --> 02:28.290
I was able to come out 
because my sister fell ill.

02:28.290 --> 02:30.490
<i>She was </i>able<i> to?</i>

02:30.490 --> 02:34.700
I look forward to your ongoing support of her.

04:06.500 --> 04:09.570
And therefore, thus...

04:09.570 --> 04:12.390
<i>She's just listening quietly in class.</i>

04:13.020 --> 04:15.870
<i>Why exactly is she here?</i>

04:16.680 --> 04:19.360
<i>Did Amane send her to keep watch over me?</i>

04:22.200 --> 04:23.970
<i>What is she squirming for?</i>

04:28.250 --> 04:31.210
<i>She's struggling to get the lead into 
her mechanical pencil!</i>

04:33.140 --> 04:35.290
<i>Maybe I'm just overthinking it.</i>

04:35.290 --> 04:37.550
<i>She's just listening to the lecture properly.</i>

04:37.550 --> 04:40.170
<i>Look at her with her tongue out.</i>

04:40.170 --> 04:41.670
<i>She's so clumsy.</i>

04:44.270 --> 04:48.050
And so, therefore, thus...

04:50.310 --> 04:51.560
<i>How could you?!</i>

04:51.900 --> 04:53.190
Oh, no.

04:53.870 --> 04:55.400
Foul.

04:55.400 --> 04:58.170
<i>What's that face like her hand just slipped?!</i>

04:58.170 --> 05:01.390
<i>That was obviously on purpose!</i>

05:09.740 --> 05:12.400
I can't get enough of Lilia-oneesama!

05:12.400 --> 05:15.410
I can't help but agree with Hirota this time.

05:15.730 --> 05:20.170
<i>I bet they'd be shocked if they 
found out she nearly killed me.</i>

05:24.170 --> 05:26.460
<i>That's when Akutsu experienced...</i>

05:26.460 --> 05:30.430
<i>What an angel most feels about a demon...</i>

05:30.430 --> 05:32.430
<b>GLARE</b>

05:30.730 --> 05:31.910
<i>A desire to kill.</i>

05:33.090 --> 05:36.520
<i>His body took on 
a defensive posture instinctively.</i>

05:36.940 --> 05:40.670
<i>It was a reaction that was 
instilled in him, as a demon,</i>

05:40.670 --> 05:42.440
<i>having been dominated 
by angels for so long.</i>

05:51.130 --> 05:53.700
Akkun, are you all right?!

05:57.780 --> 06:00.830
<i>Look at her, asking me to 
come out here where it's so quiet.</i>

06:01.150 --> 06:03.980
<i>Just attack me properly, damn it.</i>

06:03.980 --> 06:04.920
I apologize.

06:06.730 --> 06:09.890
Y-You mean about volleyball?

06:09.890 --> 06:11.470
No, not that.

06:12.020 --> 06:15.390
About my having attacked you 
and Lily-sama the other day.

06:16.590 --> 06:20.680
I wasn't aware of it, but that 
doesn't change what I did.

06:20.680 --> 06:21.940
W-Wait...

06:23.190 --> 06:25.940
I truly do regret it.

06:27.070 --> 06:28.780
It's fine.

06:29.100 --> 06:31.630
You were being manipulated, 
so there's nothing you could have done.

06:31.630 --> 06:33.960
It's not your fault at all.

06:34.930 --> 06:36.420
You'll forgive me?

06:37.070 --> 06:38.580
Just this once.

06:41.030 --> 06:42.130
Thank you.

06:43.090 --> 06:44.380
S-Sure.

06:51.170 --> 06:54.190
You're a rather peculiar demon.

06:54.190 --> 06:56.980
You're pretty weird yourself.

06:56.980 --> 07:00.280
No one apologizes to their master's enemy.

07:00.280 --> 07:01.100
Do they not?

07:01.100 --> 07:02.800
They don't.

07:02.800 --> 07:04.980
You have a weird resemblance to Amane.

07:05.420 --> 07:09.630
From the moment we are embedded into 
our masters, we are influenced by their souls.

07:10.220 --> 07:13.490
Not just our appearances, 
but personality, decision-making,

07:13.490 --> 07:16.490
and behaviors are strongly affected.

07:17.450 --> 07:22.000
Some masters seem not to allow us 
to take on self-awareness.

07:22.340 --> 07:26.130
So you made the decision to apologize yourself?

07:26.590 --> 07:28.380
That was part of the reason, 
but there's another.

07:29.550 --> 07:32.750
I was curious about this place.

07:33.540 --> 07:34.600
About school.

07:35.060 --> 07:36.560
Why?

07:38.060 --> 07:40.810
I am normally inside Lily-sama.

07:40.810 --> 07:44.890
I know what she feels and what she's thinking.

07:45.490 --> 07:48.150
Lily-sama has changed since she came here.

07:48.570 --> 07:52.120
She seems to have some challenges 
in her interactions with other people,

07:52.120 --> 07:55.320
but she also seems to be 
genuinely enjoying her time here.

07:55.900 --> 07:59.330
In Heaven, just watching her was painful.

07:59.960 --> 08:04.580
Which is why I wanted to see the place 
that had changed her so drastically.

08:06.020 --> 08:09.420
That's the reason I came here.

08:10.200 --> 08:11.530
I see.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.180
Wait a second.

08:15.480 --> 08:19.430
I don't see any reason for you to have 
attacked me in what you just told me!

08:19.730 --> 08:22.640
Like the pencil lead or the murder spike!

08:22.640 --> 08:24.080
That's right!

08:24.080 --> 08:26.060
That was my act of protest!

08:26.060 --> 08:30.980
Lily-sama fell ill because of what you did!

08:33.060 --> 08:34.150
What are you talking about?

08:34.440 --> 08:36.240
Ask your own heart!

08:36.240 --> 08:38.240
<b>Hmm....</b>

08:36.610 --> 08:38.330
Hmm....

08:39.490 --> 08:41.160
I have no idea.

08:41.450 --> 08:42.650
Shock!

08:41.500 --> 08:42.330
<b>Shock!</b>

08:43.710 --> 08:46.750
<i>M-My poor Lily-sama...</i>

08:46.750 --> 08:48.670
I'll tell you, then!

08:48.670 --> 08:51.330
You <i>knew</i> Lily-sama was drawn to you!

08:51.330 --> 08:54.510
Yet you were getting friendly with 
another woman while she watched!

08:58.840 --> 09:01.010
Hmm, hmm, hmm...

09:01.360 --> 09:03.680
Shoot, I couldn't contain myself.

09:04.310 --> 09:05.310
Tanahashi!

09:05.690 --> 09:07.800
Hey, you two.

09:09.170 --> 09:11.720
Kensaku told me you'd be here.

09:11.720 --> 09:13.320
I-I see.

09:13.620 --> 09:16.570
I have a bit of a request.

09:21.330 --> 09:24.250
Let's say hi, then go home right away.

09:24.680 --> 09:25.940
<i>Tanahashi-san.</i>

09:25.940 --> 09:28.170
<i>I wish you hadn't invited me.</i>

09:28.940 --> 09:31.170
<i>I really don't want to see her today.</i>

09:33.890 --> 09:34.730
<i>Hello?</i>

09:34.730 --> 09:35.670
Hello!

09:36.210 --> 09:37.330
<i>Yuka-chan?</i>

09:37.330 --> 09:38.190
Yup, yup.

09:38.190 --> 09:39.620
We came to say hi.

09:40.500 --> 09:42.520
<i>Thanks for coming all this way for me.</i>

09:43.740 --> 09:45.470
Where do you think you're going?

09:45.470 --> 09:47.060
L-Let me go.

09:47.330 --> 09:50.030
Is there a reason you can't face her?

09:51.690 --> 09:55.400
You didn't tell her you were 
coming to school, did you?

09:55.400 --> 09:57.400
H-How did you...

09:57.400 --> 10:01.780
Which means there's a good chance you'll 
get scolded if you go home right now.

10:02.340 --> 10:04.160
She said we can come in.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.830
Let's pop by for a bit.

10:06.290 --> 10:07.340
See?

10:07.340 --> 10:09.470
You heard what your master said.

10:09.470 --> 10:10.580
You don't need to be shy.

10:10.930 --> 10:13.500
No, that's not...

10:13.870 --> 10:16.660
Don't you trust the man you fought with?

10:16.660 --> 10:18.320
Let's go together...

10:18.320 --> 10:20.510
To the doorstep of Hell!

10:25.320 --> 10:26.340
Come in.

10:26.340 --> 10:27.940
Hey, Lily-chan.

10:27.940 --> 10:28.980
Are you doing all right?

10:28.980 --> 10:29.940
Yeah.

10:29.940 --> 10:31.860
My fever's come down.

10:31.860 --> 10:33.810
Sorry for worrying you.

10:33.810 --> 10:36.110
Hey, we're buddies.

10:36.110 --> 10:38.280
H-Hey.

10:38.580 --> 10:40.410
You came too, huh?

10:40.410 --> 10:42.140
And...

10:43.890 --> 10:45.040
I'm home.

10:46.650 --> 10:48.210
<i>Why is she here?!</i>

10:51.340 --> 10:54.690
I never knew you had such 
a wonderful older sister.

10:54.690 --> 10:55.870
I'm jealous.

10:55.870 --> 10:57.700
I-I know, right?

10:57.700 --> 11:01.020
She hasn't caused you any 
trouble, though, has she?

11:01.020 --> 11:02.040
Not at all.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.600
She was really popular, in fact.

11:03.930 --> 11:05.780
I-I see.

11:06.550 --> 11:08.560
You don't need to worry.

11:08.560 --> 11:12.010
I went to school to see how 
my sister spends her time

11:12.010 --> 11:16.580
and to make sure she isn't 
a nuisance to those around her.

11:16.580 --> 11:19.700
As your older sister, I would 
never do anything to cause trouble.

11:19.950 --> 11:21.550
Exactly!

11:21.550 --> 11:23.810
I'm surprised she 
had an older sister, though.

11:23.810 --> 11:26.790
Lily-chan doesn't really talk about 
herself that much.

11:27.100 --> 11:30.220
I must make sure 
you know my sister better, then.

11:30.220 --> 11:32.620
My younger sister's height is 143 centimeters.

11:33.290 --> 11:34.630
Her weight is...

11:35.420 --> 11:36.690
Her measurements are...

11:37.450 --> 11:40.390
When bathing, she first washes her...

11:42.340 --> 11:43.960
What are you telling them?!

11:43.960 --> 11:47.680
I simply wanted them to know more about you.

11:47.680 --> 11:49.100
I-It's fine!

11:49.100 --> 11:51.480
Onee-chan, could you go 
buy more bathtub cleaner?

11:51.480 --> 11:52.530
We're all out.

11:52.530 --> 11:55.730
But as your older sister, 
it's my duty to tend to our guests.

11:56.220 --> 11:58.570
I'm your precious little sister.

11:58.930 --> 12:00.720
Please, Onee-chan?

12:00.720 --> 12:04.410
<i>Keep it up and I'm going to 
return you for a refund.</i>

12:00.780 --> 12:04.410
<b>Keep it up and
I'm going to return
you for a refund.</b>

12:04.410 --> 12:05.950
Y-You're right.

12:05.950 --> 12:07.810
Bathroom cleaner is important.

12:07.810 --> 12:09.460
Well, take care!

12:10.220 --> 12:13.290
I'm going to bring some more tea.

12:14.420 --> 12:16.590
Thank you.

12:16.910 --> 12:20.420
<i>Letting her be self-aware 
may have been a mistake.</i>

12:21.950 --> 12:23.700
Oh, right.

12:23.700 --> 12:25.140
Lily-chan's still recovering.

12:25.140 --> 12:27.980
I wonder if she'll be okay on her own.

12:27.980 --> 12:30.520
I-I'll go check on her.

12:30.520 --> 12:31.680
You should.

12:33.590 --> 12:35.420
Go get her, Akutsu-kun.

12:39.250 --> 12:40.940
<i>This is bad.</i>

12:41.550 --> 12:43.830
<i>I'm feeling sick again.</i>

12:43.830 --> 12:48.580
<i>I should ask them to let me 
lie down again after I serve this.</i>

12:49.150 --> 12:50.490
Of course.

12:52.510 --> 12:55.080
I had a feeling I'd need to check on you.

12:55.990 --> 12:57.080
Akutsu...

12:57.370 --> 12:59.440
You're burning up.

12:59.440 --> 13:01.250
You definitely have a fever.

13:03.340 --> 13:05.030
I don't think it could ever happen.

13:06.130 --> 13:07.720
Don't touch me!

13:08.200 --> 13:10.280
Are you angry?

13:10.910 --> 13:12.470
I'm not angry.

13:13.350 --> 13:16.370
Go back and wait for me with your Yuka-chan.

13:16.370 --> 13:17.850
What's that supposed to mean?

13:18.250 --> 13:19.820
Oh, yeah.

13:19.820 --> 13:22.190
Speaking of Yuka-chan, 
how did it go the other day?

13:22.190 --> 13:23.900
That date.

13:23.900 --> 13:26.030
<i>My mind's going haywire.</i>

13:26.030 --> 13:27.410
<i>I can't control myself.</i>

13:27.870 --> 13:29.240
What's gotten into you?

13:29.240 --> 13:32.700
<i>I'm overflowing with awful emotions.</i>

13:32.980 --> 13:34.490
It's fine.

13:34.490 --> 13:36.090
You had fun, didn't you?

13:36.090 --> 13:38.840
She knows where to go for a fun time, too.

13:38.840 --> 13:40.360
Unlike me.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.820
So, how was it?

13:43.820 --> 13:45.720
<i>Right now, I...</i>

13:47.630 --> 13:49.050
Well...

13:50.420 --> 13:53.160
It was fun, in its own way.

13:53.160 --> 13:55.810
<i>I'm making an ugly face.</i>

13:56.970 --> 13:59.140
More than when you're with me?

13:59.140 --> 13:59.770
Huh?

13:59.770 --> 14:01.020
Never mind!

14:01.020 --> 14:02.050
H-Hey!

14:02.050 --> 14:04.500
Just go away!

14:04.500 --> 14:05.850
All right, fine.

14:05.850 --> 14:07.210
Your fever's going to get worse.

14:07.210 --> 14:08.150
Shut up!

14:08.570 --> 14:09.650
<i>That's right.</i>

14:10.230 --> 14:14.270
<i>My horrible emotions, my odd comments...</i>

14:15.180 --> 14:16.660
<i>It must all be because of my cold.</i>

14:16.960 --> 14:17.860
Amane!

14:22.820 --> 14:23.950
She's up.

14:23.950 --> 14:25.180
Are you okay?

14:25.180 --> 14:26.800
Y-Yeah.

14:27.120 --> 14:29.810
Akutsu-kun carried you here.

14:29.810 --> 14:31.010
I see.

14:31.420 --> 14:33.810
Sorry, I didn't notice.

14:35.110 --> 14:36.270
Nah.

14:37.070 --> 14:38.770
Now, then...

14:38.770 --> 14:42.540
I wish I could stick around, 
but I got some stuff to do back home.

14:42.540 --> 14:45.570
Akutsu-kun will stick around 
until your sister's back.

14:45.960 --> 14:46.690
Huh?

14:46.690 --> 14:48.140
O-Okay.

14:48.140 --> 14:49.490
Thanks.

14:49.900 --> 14:51.160
Take care.

14:51.660 --> 14:53.100
Hey, Lily-chan...

14:53.100 --> 14:55.160
Akutsu-kun's nice, don't you think?

14:58.120 --> 15:00.200
Yeah, he is.

15:01.000 --> 15:02.970
Lily-chan's relaxing.

15:02.970 --> 15:03.900
Yeah?

15:03.900 --> 15:05.550
Well, I'm going home.

15:06.420 --> 15:07.790
I'm warning you, don't do anything.

15:07.790 --> 15:09.880
I won't. Just go.

15:09.880 --> 15:11.070
Sure.

15:11.070 --> 15:12.410
Thanks for taking care of her.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.370
Oh, right, Akutsu-kun.

15:15.370 --> 15:18.640
I don't think there's such a thing as "never."

15:23.910 --> 15:26.210
<i>I really can't relax.</i>

15:26.210 --> 15:28.570
<i>This is all her fault!</i>

15:29.570 --> 15:32.010
You <i>knew</i> Lily-sama was drawn to you!

15:32.830 --> 15:35.370
<i>Meanwhile, Amane's angry for some reason.</i>

15:36.060 --> 15:38.680
<i>Does it have something to do 
with what Lilia was saying?</i>

15:39.050 --> 15:43.420
<i>Does that mean Amane was nearby 
when I was hanging out with Tanahashi...</i>

15:43.420 --> 15:44.460
<i>And something happened?</i>

15:45.230 --> 15:46.190
<i>That's it!</i>

15:46.190 --> 15:47.500
<i>That day, she was like...</i>

15:47.890 --> 15:52.010
Akutsu-kun, wanna go 
in the fitting room together?

15:52.010 --> 15:52.840
That's it!

15:53.790 --> 15:55.260
<i>No, there's no way!</i>

15:55.260 --> 15:57.660
<i>I never went in the fitting room, either way.</i>

15:57.660 --> 15:58.860
<i>That's not it!</i>

15:58.860 --> 16:00.770
<i>There has to be something more direct.</i>

16:00.770 --> 16:05.770
Do you ever wish you could go out with her?

16:05.770 --> 16:06.740
Was that it?

16:06.740 --> 16:08.320
And then, I think I said...

16:09.650 --> 16:11.460
I don't think it could ever happen.

16:14.600 --> 16:17.330
Which means Amane must have...

16:17.710 --> 16:18.830
Seen that?!

16:22.020 --> 16:23.810
<i>Amane? Is she up?</i>

16:23.810 --> 16:25.560
<i>Wait, is she all right?</i>

16:25.560 --> 16:28.520
It would be bad if something were 
to ever happen to Lily-chan.

16:28.520 --> 16:30.270
Don't you think?

16:30.270 --> 16:32.680
It'd be bad, yeah?

16:32.680 --> 16:34.840
<i>I guess I should check on her.</i>

16:35.900 --> 16:37.140
I'm coming in.

16:37.140 --> 16:38.970
N-No...

16:39.370 --> 16:41.720
Please, don't...

16:41.720 --> 16:43.150
I'm begging you.

16:43.150 --> 16:44.100
Help me.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.650
<i>She's having a horrible nightmare.</i>

16:47.090 --> 16:48.980
<i>Should I wake her up?</i>

16:50.120 --> 16:52.150
A-Akutsu...

16:56.360 --> 16:58.410
Hey! A-Amane!

16:58.730 --> 17:01.250
A-Akutsu?

17:01.250 --> 17:03.370
Why are you here?

17:03.370 --> 17:04.290
Er...

17:04.290 --> 17:06.810
You seemed really upset, so I got worried.

17:06.810 --> 17:08.260
I see.

17:08.260 --> 17:10.060
So, Amane-san...

17:10.060 --> 17:11.090
What?

17:11.470 --> 17:13.420
Would you please tell me?

17:14.710 --> 17:15.870
Tell you what?

17:18.380 --> 17:19.350
Yeah.

17:20.790 --> 17:22.640
You can leave now.

17:22.640 --> 17:24.350
My fever's gone.

17:24.640 --> 17:27.730
I just had a bad dream.

17:29.220 --> 17:32.290
You're right, your fever is gone.

17:33.590 --> 17:36.020
Wait, is it coming back?

17:36.020 --> 17:38.500
Wh-Wh-What do you think you're doing?

17:38.500 --> 17:40.490
Yup, you're back to your usual self.

17:41.330 --> 17:44.180
I'll be in the living room 
until Lilia comes back.

17:45.240 --> 17:49.570
It might be annoying, but it's only for 
a short while, so bear with me.

17:51.060 --> 17:53.260
I-I don't care.

17:54.440 --> 17:57.020
Oh, about Lilia...

17:57.020 --> 17:59.440
What do you think she came to school for?

17:59.440 --> 18:00.610
Dunno.

18:00.610 --> 18:03.160
She came to apologize to me.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.880
For when she was manipulated.

18:04.880 --> 18:05.760
Oh?

18:05.760 --> 18:06.980
You know...

18:06.980 --> 18:08.930
She's definitely a lot like you.

18:08.930 --> 18:10.890
Specifically, the way she's so earnest.

18:10.650 --> 18:11.820
<b>Hahaha</b>

18:12.100 --> 18:13.870
What did you expect?

18:13.870 --> 18:17.620
She's been influenced by me, after all.

18:17.620 --> 18:22.600
Of course she's beautiful on 
the outside as well as on the inside.

18:22.600 --> 18:24.030
Sure, well...

18:24.830 --> 18:27.340
Why are you giving me 
that thoughtless reaction?!

18:27.340 --> 18:29.200
It's not thoughtless.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.620
But, thinking about it...

18:32.870 --> 18:35.540
This might be a stupid thought,

18:36.380 --> 18:41.760
but if angels are all like you, 
maybe we don't need to fight at all.

18:44.460 --> 18:46.660
That's definitely a stupid thought.

18:46.660 --> 18:47.560
Forget I mentioned it.

18:48.220 --> 18:50.140
That really is stupid.

18:50.140 --> 18:51.170
Yeah.

18:51.170 --> 18:54.790
Then, if all demons were like you...

18:56.420 --> 18:57.320
What?

18:57.660 --> 18:59.490
It would be hell on earth.

18:59.490 --> 19:00.350
Shut up!

19:01.330 --> 19:03.580
Sorry, I don't want you to get sick again.

19:03.580 --> 19:04.920
Let me know if you need anything.

19:04.920 --> 19:07.120
I said you can leave now.

19:08.060 --> 19:09.720
You should depend on me.

19:09.720 --> 19:11.310
You're sick, aren't you?

19:11.310 --> 19:12.880
It's a ceasefire.

19:14.450 --> 19:16.750
<i>Depend on him, huh?</i>

19:17.650 --> 19:19.500
Take care, then.

19:19.500 --> 19:20.780
H-Hey...

19:21.750 --> 19:27.520
I-I only grabbed your sleeve because 
I was having a nightmare, okay?

19:27.520 --> 19:28.200
Right.

19:28.200 --> 19:30.420
And, so...

19:30.420 --> 19:32.520
Just in case...

19:32.520 --> 19:33.400
What?

19:33.400 --> 19:37.800
Just to make sure I don't have 
another nightmare...

19:38.370 --> 19:42.160
I-I want you to, well...

19:42.160 --> 19:50.220
Hold my hand until I fall asleep.

19:53.260 --> 19:55.230
Wh-Where did that come from?!

19:55.230 --> 19:57.530
I-I'm just asking!

19:57.530 --> 20:00.170
You were the one who told me to depend on you!

20:00.170 --> 20:02.300
I did, but...

20:00.420 --> 20:02.300
<b>I did, but...</b>

20:02.300 --> 20:05.550
I-It's just that I had a nightmare.

20:05.990 --> 20:07.580
And I'm not feeling great.

20:10.010 --> 20:12.560
So I just felt like asking.

20:15.010 --> 20:18.930
<i>I guess I was the one 
who called the ceasefire.</i>

20:18.930 --> 20:23.480
<i>And it's not like she's ever 
this honest with herself.</i>

20:24.320 --> 20:25.660
All right, fine.

20:25.980 --> 20:27.160
Until you fall asleep.

20:33.550 --> 20:34.490
Right.

20:36.690 --> 20:37.670
I'm back.

20:40.430 --> 20:41.800
What are the two of you doing?

20:41.800 --> 20:43.940
N-N-N-Nothing!

20:43.940 --> 20:45.500
And where is the cleaner?!

20:45.500 --> 20:46.570
I bought some.

20:46.570 --> 20:48.400
But there's just one problem.

20:48.400 --> 20:50.320
Wh-What?

20:50.320 --> 20:54.210
For a little while now, my chest,

20:54.210 --> 20:59.140
has been feeling strangely 
warm and bittersweet.

20:59.140 --> 21:04.360
I interpret this as 
your emotions flowing into me.

21:04.760 --> 21:07.620
So, what were the two of you doing?

21:07.980 --> 21:09.580
<i>I'm about to burst.</i>

21:09.580 --> 21:10.970
Lily-sama?

21:12.200 --> 21:13.540
Lily-sama?!

21:32.810 --> 21:34.770
Come on, what are you waiting for?

21:35.090 --> 21:37.770
It's another good day of demon hunting.

21:38.040 --> 21:40.040
Right after you recovered?

21:40.790 --> 21:43.390
I need no rest.

21:43.390 --> 21:45.370
Why don't we have something to eat first?

21:45.370 --> 21:47.030
I shall treat you to thank you for visiting me.

21:47.030 --> 21:47.970
Really?

21:47.970 --> 21:48.920
Indeed.

21:48.920 --> 21:50.370
What should I ask for?

21:50.370 --> 21:51.810
I think I should go with boiled gyoza.

21:51.810 --> 21:53.290
Fried, then.

21:53.290 --> 21:55.910
I finally found you.

21:58.540 --> 22:00.170
It's been a while.

22:00.520 --> 22:05.170
You seem to be enjoying yourself, Lily.
